      "text": "The envoy invokes their diplomatic status. Until the end of the envoy's next turn, any creature that attempts to attack them must succeed at a DC 15 Will save save or have their attack disrupted. The attacker gains weakness 2 to all damage from the envoy's allies while Diplomatic Immunity lasts, whether their attack was disrupted or not.\n\n---\nEffect: Diplomatic Immunity"
